        rdfs:comment                   "Piece. Brocaded in silver wire wound on a silk core and polychrome silks on a ground of ivory ribbed silk. Large floral arrangements with pineaples and scrolls in silver. Lined with natural-colored linen plain cloth. Folded, soiled, stained, many splits and holes. Worn, silver tarnished, repaired with running stitches."@en ;
